<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Korea Line TBN - 140,000-200,000 tonnes coal Tuburao/South Korea 23/11-8/12 $8.51 fio eight days shinc Posco.</p>
<p>Docebay - 145,000 tonnes coal Richards Bay/Hadera 27/11-10/12 approx. $5.70 fio scale load/20,000 shex Cetragpa.</p>
<p>ORE - Cape America - 140,000 tonnes ore Sepetiba/Dunkirk East and West 10-25/11 $6.30 fio six days shinc Coe and Clerici.</p>
<p>Hassbat Qatar - 120,000 tonnes ore Seven Islands/Ijmuiden 18-24/10 $3.75 fio six days shinc Cobam.</p>
</text>
